---
/* "Back to top" for the end of long pages (timeline, blog posts, FAQ). "#top" is the top of the document
 * by the HTML spec, so no element or script is needed, and following it moves the keyboard's starting
 * point back to the start of the page too. The scroll is smooth only without reduced motion
 * (html scroll-behavior in global.css). */
---

<div class="container back-to-top">
  <a class="link-arrow" href="#top">
    Back to top <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span>
  </a>
</div>
